  "title": "OR Royalties Declares Third Quarter 2026 Dividend",
  "summary": "Download in pdf MONTRÉAL, Aug. 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — OR Royalties Inc. (“OR Royalties” or the “Company”) (OR: TSX & NYSE) is pleased to announce that the Company’s Board of Directors has approved a third quarter 2026 dividend of US$0.065 per common share. The dividend will be paid on October 15, 2026 to […]",
